{"concern_id":"rf0-criteria-miss-handoff","evidence":[{"artifact_path":".gnd-planning/milestones/code-refactoring/notes/code-refactoring-plan.md","location":"RF0 lines 125-132","observation":"The outcome includes \"a recorded handoff of the `runtime` and `test-acceptance` units\" and the step \"Settle RF-D2 to RF-D4\", but RF0-C1..C3 cover only the tool, the audit rows and the pin inventory. RF-D2 is already \"Ruled\" at line 327."}],"recommendation":"Add RF0 criteria for the handoff record, the updated ownership test and the RF-D3/RF-D4 rulings. Drop RF-D2 from the RF0 list.","relevance":"hardening","severity":"low","title":"RF0 criteria do not verify the handoff that RF-R7 requires before edits"}
